        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Koster, Ed Martin, Edward Robert Martin Jr., Phyllis Schlafly\n- Roles: Missouri Attorney General, attorney, politician, president, CNN contributor\n- Organizations: Phyllis Schlafly Eagles, CNN\n- Events: Missouri attorney general election, 2012\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2012 Missouri attorney general election, incumbent Missouri Attorney General Chris Koster, a Democrat, won re-election to a second full term.\n- In the 2012 Missouri attorney general election, Chris Koster defeated Republican attorney Ed Martin.\n- Edward Robert Martin Jr. is an American politician and attorney from Missouri.\n- Ed Martin serves as president of Phyllis Schlafly Eagles.\n- Ed Martin is a CNN contributor.",
